,Use Grid


,**
,**
,** SET COSTS FOR PVC Slatwall Colors
,** 
,**
,**  
,** 
DisplaySet, #PVCColorname1=White, 1.0 PCV Slatwall Color Name
DisplaySet, #PVCColorcost1=16, 1.1 PCV Slatwall Color ft2 cost
DisplaySet, #PVCColorPartNumber1=792.10.721, 1.2 PCV Slatwall Color Part Number
Set, (#unitfilename="*#PVCColorname1*"):#SlatWallName=#PVCColorname1-#PVCColorPartNumber1
Set, (#unitfilename="*#PVCColorname1*"):#CostSlatWallPerSqFt=#PVCColorcost1
